<title>HUNGARY: IEB H1 '97 after-tax profit HUF 1.23 bln.</title>
<headline>IEB H1 '97 after-tax profit HUF 1.23 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-June 1997	 Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    1,067.3	vs	1,053.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		1,229.0	vs	1,106.7</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	    1,229.0	vs	1,106.7</p>
<p>    Net interest income	 1,717.7 profit vs 1,508.1 profit</p>
<p>	 Interest revenue	 9,942.7	  vs 7,215.0</p>
<p>	 Interest expenditure   8,245.0	  vs 5,706.9</p>
<p>    Dividend received		4.9	  vs    18.6</p>
<p>    Other operating revenue  1,357.8	  vs 1,111.2</p>
<p>    Other revenue		   53.7	  vs    13.4</p>
<p>    Operating costs	    1,379.8	  vs 1,053.5</p>
<p>    Other operating expend.    345.9	  vs   197.7</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   341.0	  vs   346.8</p>
<p>Net income from non-core</p>
<p>	  activity		    45.1 profit vs    43.0 profit</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income   116.7 profit vs    10.5 profit</p>
<p>    Taxation			   0.0	  vs     0.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Inter-Europa Bank Rt is a commercial bank. The figures are  consolidated, unaudited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian  Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
